{
  "$comment": [
    "SHARED CHANNEL CASES - the contract between every copy of the request",
    "channel list, the publish rule for channel rules and the function that",
    "resolves a form for a channel:",
    "  channels       Apps/MyssFormSpec/RequestChannels.cs, Apps/MyssFormio/src/requestChannels.ts,",
    "                 Apps/MyssContent/src/lib/request-channels.ts",
    "  publishCases   Apps/MyssContent/src/lib/form-spec-rules.ts (Strapi, the authoritative gate),",
    "                 Apps/MyssFormio/src/specRules.ts (the form editor's early warning),",
    "                 Apps/MyssFormSpec/ChannelRules.cs (ValidateSpecStructure, the API's fast 422)",
    "  resolveCases   Apps/MyssFormSpec/ChannelSpec.cs (the APIs), Apps/MyssFormio/src/channelSpec.ts",
    "                 (the form editor's preview)",
    "",
    "A component's channel rules are properties.myssChannels: an object keyed by",
    "channel, each value an object with show and/or required, both true or false.",
    "show: false removes the component, and everything inside it, from the form",
    "for that channel; required sets validate.required for that channel. A",
    "component shown in a channel must not depend on a component hidden in it:",
    "through conditional.when, properties.myssMatches, a day's myssDateParts",
    "(when myssValidator is dateParts), or as a repeat section's count question.",
    "",
    "Each publish case expects exactly the listed problems, in this order and in",
    "this wording, and is otherwise a valid spec. Each resolve case gives the",
    "resolved form for every channel; the resolved form has no myssChannels.",
    "Rule and setting names are reported in document order; a name that looks",
    "like a whole number is avoided here, because JavaScript lists those first."
  ],
  "channels": [ "client", "worker-override" ],
  "publishCases": [
    {
      "name": "valid rules: the SIN optional for a worker, a note for workers only",
      "spec": { "components": [
        { "type": "textfield", "key": "sin", "validate": { "required": true },
          "properties": { "myssValidator": "sin", "myssChannels": { "worker-override": { "required": false } } } },
        { "type": "textarea", "key": "workerNote",
          "properties": { "myssChannels": { "client": { "show": false }, "worker-override": { "show": true, "required": true } } } }
      ] },
      "problems": []
    },
    {
      "name": "valid rules on a panel, a field in a column and a field in a repeat section's row",
      "spec": { "components": [
        { "type": "panel", "key": "employment",
          "properties": { "myssChannels": { "worker-override": { "show": false } } },
          "components": [ { "type": "textfield", "key": "employer" } ] },
        { "type": "columns", "key": "nameColumns", "columns": [
          { "components": [ { "type": "textfield", "key": "middleName",
            "properties": { "myssChannels": { "client": { "required": false } } } } ] }
        ] },
        { "type": "number", "key": "childCount" },
        { "type": "bcgovRepeatSection", "key": "children", "properties": { "myssRepeatCount": "childCount" },
          "components": [ { "type": "textfield", "key": "childSin",
            "properties": { "myssChannels": { "worker-override": { "required": false } } } } ] }
      ] },
      "problems": []
    },
    {
      "name": "null channel rules are no rules",
      "spec": { "components": [
        { "type": "textfield", "key": "sin", "properties": { "myssChannels": null } }
      ] },
      "problems": []
    },
    {
      "name": "channel rules that are a list or text",
      "spec": { "components": [
        { "type": "textfield", "key": "sin", "properties": { "myssChannels": [ "worker-override" ] } },
        { "type": "textfield", "key": "phone", "properties": { "myssChannels": "client" } }
      ] },
      "problems": [
        "The channel rules of \"sin\" must be an object keyed by channel.",
        "The channel rules of \"phone\" must be an object keyed by channel."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "unknown channels, compared exactly",
      "spec": { "components": [
        { "type": "textfield", "key": "sin",
          "properties": { "myssChannels": { "Client": { "required": false }, "applicant-override": { "show": false } } } }
      ] },
      "problems": [
        "The channel rules of \"sin\" name \"Client\", which is not a channel.",
        "The channel rules of \"sin\" name \"applicant-override\", which is not a channel."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "rules that are not objects",
      "spec": { "components": [
        { "type": "textfield", "key": "sin", "properties": { "myssChannels": { "client": true, "worker-override": null } } }
      ] },
      "problems": [
        "The channel rule of \"sin\" for \"client\" must be an object.",
        "The channel rule of \"sin\" for \"worker-override\" must be an object."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "an empty rule and properties that are not an object are accepted",
      "spec": { "components": [
        { "type": "textfield", "key": "sin", "properties": { "myssChannels": { "client": {} } } },
        { "type": "textfield", "key": "phone", "properties": "worker-override" }
      ] },
      "problems": []
    },
    {
      "name": "an unknown setting",
      "spec": { "components": [
        { "type": "textfield", "key": "sin",
          "properties": { "myssChannels": { "worker-override": { "visible": false, "required": false } } } }
      ] },
      "problems": [
        "The channel rule of \"sin\" for \"worker-override\" has \"visible\"; only show and required are allowed."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "settings that are not true or false",
      "spec": { "components": [
        { "type": "textfield", "key": "sin",
          "properties": { "myssChannels": { "client": { "show": "false", "required": 1 } } } }
      ] },
      "problems": [
        "The channel rule of \"sin\" for \"client\" must set \"show\" to true or false.",
        "The channel rule of \"sin\" for \"client\" must set \"required\" to true or false."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a shown field that depends on a field hidden in the same channel",
      "spec": { "components": [
        { "type": "radio", "key": "hasSpouse",
          "properties": { "myssChannels": { "worker-override": { "show": false } } } },
        { "type": "textfield", "key": "spouseName", "conditional": { "show": true, "when": "hasSpouse", "eq": "yes" } }
      ] },
      "problems": [
        "\"spouseName\" depends on \"hasSpouse\", which is hidden for the worker-override channel."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a dependent field hidden in the same channel is accepted",
      "spec": { "components": [
        { "type": "radio", "key": "hasSpouse",
          "properties": { "myssChannels": { "worker-override": { "show": false } } } },
        { "type": "textfield", "key": "spouseName", "conditional": { "show": true, "when": "hasSpouse", "eq": "yes" },
          "properties": { "myssChannels": { "worker-override": { "show": false } } } }
      ] },
      "problems": []
    },
    {
      "name": "a dependent field inside a panel hidden in the same channel is accepted",
      "spec": { "components": [
        { "type": "radio", "key": "hasSpouse",
          "properties": { "myssChannels": { "worker-override": { "show": false } } } },
        { "type": "panel", "key": "spouse",
          "properties": { "myssChannels": { "worker-override": { "show": false } } },
          "components": [
            { "type": "textfield", "key": "spouseName", "conditional": { "show": true, "when": "hasSpouse", "eq": "yes" } }
          ] }
      ] },
      "problems": []
    },
    {
      "name": "a field that depends on a question inside a panel hidden in the channel",
      "spec": { "components": [
        { "type": "panel", "key": "household",
          "properties": { "myssChannels": { "client": { "show": false } } },
          "components": [ { "type": "radio", "key": "hasSpouse" } ] },
        { "type": "textfield", "key": "spouseName", "conditional": { "show": true, "when": "hasSpouse", "eq": "yes" } }
      ] },
      "problems": [
        "\"spouseName\" depends on \"hasSpouse\", which is hidden for the client channel."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a panel that depends on a field hidden in the channel",
      "spec": { "components": [
        { "type": "radio", "key": "hasSpouse",
          "properties": { "myssChannels": { "worker-override": { "show": false } } } },
        { "type": "panel", "key": "spouseDetails", "conditional": { "show": true, "when": "hasSpouse", "eq": "yes" },
          "components": [ { "type": "textfield", "key": "spouseName" } ] }
      ] },
      "problems": [
        "\"spouseDetails\" depends on \"hasSpouse\", which is hidden for the worker-override channel."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a question kept shown does not hide its dependants",
      "spec": { "components": [
        { "type": "radio", "key": "hasSpouse",
          "properties": { "myssChannels": { "worker-override": { "show": true, "required": false } } } },
        { "type": "textfield", "key": "spouseName", "conditional": { "show": true, "when": "hasSpouse", "eq": "yes" } }
      ] },
      "problems": []
    },
    {
      "name": "a repeat section shown in a channel whose count question is hidden in it",
      "spec": { "components": [
        { "type": "number", "key": "childCount",
          "properties": { "myssChannels": { "client": { "show": false } } } },
        { "type": "bcgovRepeatSection", "key": "children", "properties": { "myssRepeatCount": "childCount" },
          "components": [ { "type": "textfield", "key": "childName" } ] }
      ] },
      "problems": [
        "The repeat section \"children\" counts with \"childCount\", which is hidden for the client channel."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a repeat section hidden with its count question is accepted",
      "spec": { "components": [
        { "type": "number", "key": "childCount",
          "properties": { "myssChannels": { "client": { "show": false } } } },
        { "type": "bcgovRepeatSection", "key": "children",
          "properties": { "myssRepeatCount": "childCount", "myssChannels": { "client": { "show": false } } },
          "components": [ { "type": "textfield", "key": "childName" } ] }
      ] },
      "problems": []
    },
    {
      "name": "a component's own problems come first, then each channel in order",
      "spec": { "components": [
        { "type": "radio", "key": "hasSpouse",
          "properties": { "myssChannels": { "client": { "show": false }, "worker-override": { "show": false } } } },
        { "type": "textfield", "key": "spouseName", "conditional": { "show": true, "when": "hasSpouse", "eq": "yes" },
          "properties": { "myssChannels": { "worker": { "show": true } } } }
